        "name": "NBA ShootOut",
        "summary": "NBA ShootOut was released in 1996 and was Sony's first basketball game on their 32-bit PlayStation. It featured a season mode, motion captured player animations and up to 8 player support.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/xejdqle2ghpjmnfbiqpi.jpg",
