        "id": 23152,
        "name": "Gunnm Martian Memory",
        "summary": "The winds blow the smell of oil and iron around an artificial creation, a city where people dwell between scrap and machine. In this town human beings and cyborgs live mixed-in together. Within there lives a \"mostly cyborg, tuning and maintenance\" cyberne doctor named Ido.\n\nOne day, he came out of the town and in a mountain of scrap found a cyborg girl asleep for hundreds of years and brought her back to life.",
