        "summary": "What began as a simple prophecy evolved into bloody war. A board of fantasy warriors in an epic story of a war-torn land. Battle it out with an arsenal of weapons including battle axes, broadswords, crossbows and more! Deadly interactive 3-D environments - dodge fire-pits, flying arrows and spike-lined walls forcing fighters to kill or be killed. 8 main characters with a further 10 hidden characters waiting to be unleashed!",
