        "name": "Steel Reign",
        "summary": "General Storm and his militia are out to take over the world, and it's up to you to stop them.\n\nLuckily, you are armed with a battalion of tank prototypes. While there are only three different types to choose from at the beginning, the number of choices will grow to 12 as more tanks are discovered throughout the game.",
