      {
        "id": 45007,
        "name": "Gundam Battle Assault 2",
        "summary": "Your fighting skills will be put to the ultimate test, as you challenge other pilots for the right to be called the best. As Burning Gundam, you're a martial arts specialist in search of your brother. Then as Heero Yuy in Gundam Wing, attempt to destroy Trieze Khushrenada. Finally, use Gunam RX-78 to wage war against the Principality of Zeon.\n\n* Exciting modes of play include: Street Mode, Two\n* Exciting Versus Modes, Two fast-action Time modes, and Survival Mode!\n* Follow Three Different Storylines!\n* Amazing Hand-Drawn 2D Graphics.\n* Intuitive, Smooth Controls!\n* The Most Varied Selection of Mobile Suits Yet! 30 of the most popular mobile suits from Mobile Suit Gundam, G Gundam, and Gundam Wing!",
