      {
        "id": 45097,
        "name": "Army Men: World War - Land Sea Air",
        "summary": "The war continues between the green and tan armies, with air, sea and land vehicles increasing the range of attacks.\n\nNew additions to your army include the ability to control both army men, land vehicles, ships, and aircraft (for example Helicopters, bombers, battleships, and tanks). The Army Men themselves have a larger arsenal to choose from, including the howitzer and mortars plus the usual machine guns, flamethrowers, and grenades.\n\nAs a PlayStation exclusive, a 2-player capture the flag game has been included. The single player campaigns all included multiple objectives, such as capturing an enemy base while destroying others or defending an area from intruders.",
